*   **Ilealysis:**  The loss of the ability to absorb fluids and electrolytes.
*   **Metostasis:** Reduced blood flow to the ileal loop.
*   **Skin Iritis:** Iritation of the skin around the stoma.

**3. Medium-Term (Weeks - Months)**

These complications and adjustments tend to develop as the body adapts to the ileostomy.

*   **Stoma Changes:**
