* **Improved Complete Complete Response (CR) Rate with ACVBPD:** The intensive chemotherapy arm (ACVBPD) achieved a significantly higher complete response rate (CR) – 90% vs 62% with CHOP + RT. This is a key driver of the overall outcomes.
