","Superiarycantrifaction (SFC) offers a number of advantages compared to traditional extraction techniques like traditional solvent-based extraction or Sox, and supercritical mobile pressition technique (SFC). Here a breakdown of the benefits:

**1. Selectivity & Selectivity:**

