**5. Calculate the mass of the remaining/residual gases:**

* Initial mass of air = 200 g
Mass of Sulphur used = 205 g
Mass of Sulphur Dioxide produced = 205 g
* Mass of remaining gases = Initial mass of air - mass of oxygen consumed
