|---|---|---|
| **Functional (Functional)** | Butanol vs. Butanal | Different functional groups (OH vs. CHO) |
| **Structural (Structural)** |  n-Butanol vs. t-Butal | Different carbon arrangement within the same functional group (linear vs. branched) |
