* **2) Prospective:** This is a **prospective** study. The study follows a group of women (nurses) over a period of time, tracking their behaviors (eating habits) and health. It predicts the likelihood of health outcomes based on these behaviors.

* **3) Prospective:** This is a **prosative** study. The study tracks a group of individuals over a period of time, tracking their behaviors (eating and exercise habits) and their health. It predicts the likelihood of cancer based on these behaviors.

